    "body": "On the canvas, group elements visually by one of their properties, so that elements with the same value are drawn together.\n\n- A **Group by** panel next to Show Viewpoints, where one property is chosen at a time, with Clear to go back to the canvas as it is today.\n- It offers Type, the standard properties with a single value (Architecture state, Owning team, Sourcing, Supplier HQ country, Kind) and custom properties holding text.\n- Each value gets a labelled box with its elements inside it, plus a \"Not set\" box for elements without a value.\n- Dragging a card never changes its value; changing a value moves the card to its new group.\n- In a view, the grouping is saved with the view, so everyone opens it grouped.\n",
